      "writtenOn": "2023-11-17T17:23:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about CPU-centric traces (and GPU-centric traces)? Bound seems to imply a performance bottleneck.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
        "startChar": 60,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 69
