      },
      "lineNbr": 69,
      "author": {
        "id": 10009
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-17T17:45:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I chose \"bound\" as a suffix because we already use it elsewhere, e.g.:\n\nhttps://skia.googlesource.com/skia/+/71aa8db1b14dbc1466bfa186bf1bec197e668ed1/dm/DM.cpp#147\n\nhttps://skia.googlesource.com/skia/+/71aa8db1b14dbc1466bfa186bf1bec197e668ed1/dm/DM.cpp#148\n\nI\u0027m not sure about \"centric\". The word \"CPU-centric\" could be interpreted as \"mostly\" CPU work, implying that some work might happen elsewhere, e.g. on the GPU.\n\nI\u0027m happy to drop the word \"bound\" if you still feel strongly about it; I just wanted to give you some context.",
